After success:

kubectl get nodes

Expected:

NAME           STATUS   ROLES    AGE   VERSION
ip-xxxxx       Ready    <none>   ...
🔍 STEP 9: Verify in AWS Console

Go to:

EKS → Clusters

Check:

Cluster status = Active
Compute tab shows worker nodes
